cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or these derived data, please cite the paper."
title: "What skeletal differentiation models actually measure: a lineage-independent matrix programme, and why the disease genes lie orthogonal to it"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived data for a reanalysis of eighteen published skeletal
  differentiation experiments, in which every level of evidence carries its
  own positive control and its own measured detection limit.
type: dataset
